#: rootopts.cpp:115
msgid "Enable Desktop &Menu"
msgstr "aktiveer werkskerm kieslys"

#: rootopts.cpp:117
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the desktop popup menus to appear at the top "
"of the screen in the style of Macintosh. This setting is independent of the "
"global top-level menu setting that applies to KDE applications."
msgstr ""
"bevestig hierdie opsie as jy wil hê die werkskerm opspring kieslyste aan "
"verskyn op die bo van die skerm in die styl van macintosh.  hierdie opset is "
"onafhanklike van die globale bo-level kieslys opset wat van toepassing is "
"aan kde programme."

#: rootopts.cpp:122
msgid "Enable &Icons on Desktop"
msgstr "aktiveer ikoone op werkskerm"

#: rootopts.cpp:124
msgid ""
"Uncheck this option if you do not want to have icons on the desktop. Without "
"icons the desktop will be somewhat faster but you will no longer be able to "
"drag files to the desktop."
msgstr ""

#: rootopts.cpp:129
msgid "Align Icons &Vertically on Desktop"
msgstr "oplyn ikoone vertikaal op werkskerm"

#: rootopts.cpp:131
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the icons on the desktop to be aligned "
"vertically (in columns). If you leave this option unchecked, desktop icons "
"are aligned horizontally."
"<p> Note that you can drag icons wherever you want to on the desktop. When "
"you choose \"Arrange Icons\" from the Desktop menu, icons will be arranged "
"horizontally or vertically."
msgstr ""
"bevestig hierdie opsie as jy wil hê die ikoone op die werkskerm aan wees "
"opgelyn vertikaal (in kolomme). as jy los hierdie opsie onbevestig, "
"werkskerm ikoone word opgelyn horisontaal."
"<p>"
" nota wat jy kan trek ikoone waar ook al jy wil hê aan op die werkskerm. "
"wanneer jy kies \"rangskik ikoone\" van die werkskerm kieslys, ikoone sal "
"wees gerangskik horisontaal of vertikaal."

#: rootopts.cpp:138
msgid "Show H&idden Files on Desktop"
msgstr "vertoon weg gesteekte lêers op werkskerm"

#: rootopts.cpp:140
msgid ""
"If you check this option, any files in your desktop directory that begin "
"with a period (.) will be shown. Usually, such files contain configuration "
"information, and remain hidden from view."
"<p> For example, files which are named \".directory\" are plain text files "
"which contain information for Konqueror, such as the icon to use in "
"displaying a directory, the order in which files should be sorted, etc. You "
"should not change or delete these files unless you know what you are doing!"
msgstr ""
"as jy bevestig hierdie opsie, enige lêers in jou werkskerm gids wat begin "
"met 'n periode (.) sal wees vertoon. gewoonlik, soos lêers bevat opstelling "
"informasie, en bly weg gesteekte van besigtig."
"<p> vir voorbeeld, lêers wat word genaamd \".gids\" word eenvoudig teks "
"lêers wat bevat informasie vir konqueror, soos as die ikoon aan gebruik in "
"vertooning 'n gids, die volgorde in wat lêers moet wees gesorteer, etc. jy "
"moet nie verander of uitvee hierdie lêers tensy jy ken wat jy word doen!"

#: rootopts.cpp:150
#, fuzzy
msgid "Pr&ograms in Desktop Window"
msgstr "ondersteun programme in werkskerm venster"

#: rootopts.cpp:152
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to run X11 programs that draw into the desktop "
"such as xsnow, xpenguin or xmountain. If you have problems with applications "
"like netscape that check the root window for running instances, disable this "
"option."
msgstr ""
"bevestig hierdie opsie as jy wil hê aan hardloop x11 programme wat teken "
"binnein die werkskerm soos as xsneeu, xpikkewyn of xberg. as jy het probleme "
"met programme hou van netscape wat bevestig die root venster vir wat loop "
"instansies, deaktiveer hierdie opsie."

